# An application folder that landed in the project rather than beside the settings.
# AppFolder.Path() is ApplicationData/JingleBox2, so a run whose XDG_CONFIG_HOME or HOME
# points at this directory writes one here: config.json, controllers, instruments, machines
# and a running marker. One was committed once. Nothing in the build or the code reads it.
/JingleBox2/
